    "summary": "Submitted the required checker-correspondence review for the third executed direct check, which measured the consequence of the confirmed configuration-durability defect.\n\nContext from the index: the third check was accepted and executed in a clean copy (go test exit 0, tests_passed) with checker result outcome=violated, blocked only by \"Direct oracle correspondence is unreviewed\"; unit unit-oblig-config-committed-backed-by-entry is still open, no review issues were on record, and one audit unit remains.\n\nMeasured events from that run: the admitted scenario recorded one injected StoreLogs failure with the append error and an adopted latest configuration of 2 voters at index 3; the result recorded node A as Leader, committed_voter_count 2 at committed_config_index 3 whose log entry is a LogNoop with no read error, and the joining peer's own configuration containing 1 voter.\n\nProduct contents (draft-relative submission.json): a single review item with aspect checker_correspondence and status no_issue_found on artifact fc8658b6b44d4dfdb499ccd3c54aac87. The rationale ties the fixed inputs to the proposition: the obligation (a committed configuration must be backed by a configuration entry at its index), the public call path (BootstrapCluster/NewRaft/AddVoter on two connected in-memory instances, no hand-built state), the legal history (A bootstraps as sole voter and commits its configuration entry and no-op first; B is unbootstrapped with no membership veto), the oracle (implication: committed_voter_count 2 implies the entry at that index is a configuration entry, measured from the LogStore), the identity/correlation (scenario=phantom-1 in the prerequisite and result on one stream) and completion. It explicitly records the sampling weakness that the admission event was emitted after the node had already re-campaigned, explains what actually carries the \"entry never stored\" premise, notes that neither retained counterevidence applies, and keeps restart behaviour outside the checked proposition. Optional Chinese presentation fields lead with the measured discrepancy.\n\nPreflight `validate` returned valid=true with no diagnostics. Acceptance and confirmation of the third finding remain with the controller."
